n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110705033929&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Medicine_Pouch_608dc5.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a medicine pouch.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 12.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It's easy to obtain this item as loot from <a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll\">Swamp Troll</a>, but most higher level players buy Medicine Pouch because only lower level creatures drop them.<br/> This medicine can be used to cure swamp fever - a plague  connected with humidity and starvation. Help <a href=\"#/wiki/Ottokar\">Ottokar</a> prevent the plague by delivering them to him.<br/>Can be seen in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Gardens%20of%20Night\">Gardens of Night</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33056,32347,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33056, 32347, 10)</a>.\nYou can give this item to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Ottokar\">Ottokar</a> at anytime to get a <a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a> or you can wait until the <a href=\"#/quest/swamp-fever-world-change\">Swamp Fever</a> World Change has started. If you give 100 pouches to NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Ottokar\">Ottokar</a> you'll receive the achievement  \"Doctor! Doctor!\"\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll\">Swamp Troll</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/afflicted-outfits-quest\">Afflicted Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Belongings%20of%20a%20Deceased\">Belongings of a Deceased</a></li><li>Doctor! Doctor!</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/exchange-quests\">Exchange Quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feverish%20Citizen\">Feverish Citizen</a></li><li>Guide:Moneymaking</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/swamp-fever-world-change\">Swamp Fever World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll\">Swamp Troll</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></li><li>Trolls</li><li>Venore Poorhouse</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["afflicted-outfits-quest","exchange-quests","swamp-fever-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"swamp-fever-world-change","quest":"Swamp Fever World Change","step":"0-1","n":2,"title":"Os Feverish Citizens","kind":"needed","coords":[]},{"slug":"swamp-fever-world-change","quest":"Swamp Fever World Change","step":"1-1","n":4,"title":"Caçar Medicine Pouches","kind":"needed","coords":[]},{"slug":"afflicted-outfits-quest","quest":"Afflicted Outfits Quest","step":"1-0","n":3,"title":"Lootar Medicine Pouches","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32463,"y":32328,"z":7,"label":"Gruta de Swamp Trolls a sudeste de Thais"}]},{"slug":"exchange-quests","quest":"Exchange Quests","step":"3-1","n":5,"title":